# Rice grain 1: a grain of ivory rice (kitchen_rice), 0.42 m long and 0.12 m thick (60 times life size), a blunter capsule shape than rice-grain0,
# lying on the worktop. Ground clutter: no collider.
format 1

# A fifth of the vertices its size would give it: a smooth capsule
Detail detail=0.11
    Material material=kitchen_rice
        Capsule a=(-0.15, 0.06, 0) b=(0.15, 0.06, 0) radius=0.06
